# Adding a qmldir turns this directory into an explicit module, which
# REPLACES the implicit directory listing — anything not named here stops
# resolving, including between files in this same folder. So every component
# is declared, not just the singletons that made the file necessary.
#
# The singletons are the reason this exists at all: Quickshell auto-registers
# singletons found in the config ROOT, but not in a subdirectory, and without
# these entries MpdClient and Ui resolve to nothing.
#
# Every file here also carries `import ".."` — a QML file does not see its
# parent directory implicitly, and Txt/Theme/Config live up there.

singleton MpdClient MpdClient.qml
singleton Ui        Ui.qml

Music                Music.qml
MusicBanner          MusicBanner.qml
MusicController      MusicController.qml
MusicDirectories     MusicDirectories.qml
MusicHeader          MusicHeader.qml
MusicList            MusicList.qml
MusicLyrics          MusicLyrics.qml
MusicOverlay         MusicOverlay.qml
MusicPlaylists       MusicPlaylists.qml
MusicQueue           MusicQueue.qml
MusicRow             MusicRow.qml
MusicScrollBar       MusicScrollBar.qml
MusicSearch          MusicSearch.qml
MusicStatusBar       MusicStatusBar.qml
MusicView            MusicView.qml
